eminders or Calendar\n\nSMART, BUT HONEST\nNudge understands appointments, flights, bills, deliveries, returns,\nparking sessions, bookings and more, and picks sensible alerts for each\n(three hours before a flight, three days before a bill, ten minutes\nbefore parking runs out). And when wording is genuinely ambiguous —\n\"let's call them next week\" — Nudge asks instead of guessing. Nothing\nis ever created without your say-so.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\n• Everything is understood on your iPhone — Nudge has no servers\n• Nothing you share is ever uploaded, and there's no account to create\n• No tracking, no analytics, no third-party code\n• Add-only calendar access: Nudge can add events but can't read your\n  calendar\n• Optional Face ID lock, and history stays on your device under your\n  control\n\nALSO IN NUDGE\n• Works with text, links, images, screenshots and PDFs\n• On-device text recognition for photos and screenshots\n• Create manually by pasting text, or via Siri Shortcuts\n• Local history with search, reuse and one-tap duplicates\n• Beautiful in light and dark, full Dynamic Type and VoiceOver support\n\nShare it once. Never forget it again.", "minimumOsVersion": "18.0", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "2679808", "formattedPrice": "￦1,100", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "sellerUrl": "https://amerc786.github.io/nudge-site/", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "price": 1100.0, "userRatingCount": 0}]}